    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Megabat</strong> is a pixel art 2D &quot;platformer&quot; passion project inspired by games like Celeste and Super Meat Boy, with an emphasis on using different abilities to enhance your movement. Play as fruit bat in search of food while avoiding traps and enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly, climb, and screech your way through levels!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/c00ad5894a767acfdc686c9acb856372.poster.avif?t=1750698340\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/c00ad5894a767acfdc686c9acb856372.webm?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/c00ad5894a767acfdc686c9acb856372.mp4?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid Traps and break stuff!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/585757eb60fbe88e08405404395647ad.poster.avif?t=1750698340\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/585757eb60fbe88e08405404395647ad.webm?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/585757eb60fbe88e08405404395647ad.mp4?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb walls and manage your stamina!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/32ea564fbb6899f87dd3a8b379561713.poster.avif?t=1750698340\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/32ea564fbb6899f87dd3a8b379561713.webm?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/32ea564fbb6899f87dd3a8b379561713.mp4?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned features (subject to change):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 Sections/Areas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities - Dash, Teleport, Dig, ???, ???</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Megabat</strong> is a pixel art 2D &quot;platformer&quot; passion project inspired by games like Celeste and Super Meat Boy, with an emphasis on using different abilities to enhance your movement. Play as fruit bat in search of food while avoiding traps and enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly, climb, and screech your way through levels!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/c00ad5894a767acfdc686c9acb856372.poster.avif?t=1750698340\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/c00ad5894a767acfdc686c9acb856372.webm?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/c00ad5894a767acfdc686c9acb856372.mp4?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid Traps and break stuff!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/585757eb60fbe88e08405404395647ad.poster.avif?t=1750698340\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/585757eb60fbe88e08405404395647ad.webm?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/585757eb60fbe88e08405404395647ad.mp4?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb walls and manage your stamina!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/32ea564fbb6899f87dd3a8b379561713.poster.avif?t=1750698340\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/32ea564fbb6899f87dd3a8b379561713.webm?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429230/extras/32ea564fbb6899f87dd3a8b379561713.mp4?t=1750698340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned features (subject to change):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 Sections/Areas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities - Dash, Teleport, Dig, ???, ???</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
